      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate doctors alongside turnover concerns"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers appreciate individual clinicians such as Dr. Rosen and Dr. Gooden for their empathy, gentle bedside manner, and thorough wellness advice. In contrast, several clients express dissatisfaction with high veterinarian turnover, reporting that seeing different clinicians on consecutive visits weakens continuity of care."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle physical care for companion animals"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently commend the clinical team for gentle and affectionate handling of dogs and cats during routine health checkups and vaccination visits. Clients note that veterinarians take care to minimize patient stress, providing reassuring comfort to senior animals and puppies during clinic exams."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "negative",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Ongoing delays in diagnostic communication"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Communication represents a frequent source of client frustration. Multiple reviewers report unreturned phone calls from attending doctors, extensive hold times, and multi-day delays receiving vital laboratory results. Clients also describe administrative lapses regarding lost medical records and memorial keepsakes."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can clients request to see the same veterinarian consistently?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "While clients can request preferred doctors like Dr. Rosen, reviewers note that clinic scheduling often results in seeing different veterinarians across visits."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "How are laboratory test results communicated to pet owners?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Reviewers recommend proactively following up with the front desk by phone, as promised callbacks from attending veterinarians can experience delays."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does the clinic offer end-of-life and memorial services?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, compassionate euthanasia is available, though clients advise confirming details regarding memorial keepsakes directly with administrative staff."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    }
